(5287815, 769269, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you submitted a similar shot in the light-on-white challenge, there were a couple of ballerina shoes shots, but I think this is very nice. Very soft, relaxed, elegant, and feminine. Nice shades of pink. Very good.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you submitted a similar shot in the light-on-white challenge, there were a couple of ballerina shoes shots, but I think this is very nice. Very soft, relaxed, elegant, and feminine. Nice shades of pink. Very good.', '2009-03-04 10:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287829, 769803, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the execution leaves something to be desired. Is that a bull on the t-shirt? If so, sweet. The lighting isn''t even, the corner by the wall in the upper left gets dark and having the walls in the shot is very distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the execution leaves something to be desired. Is that a bull on the t-shirt? If so, sweet. The lighting isn''t even, the corner by the wall in the upper left gets dark and having the walls in the shot is very distracting.', '2009-03-04 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287831, 769943, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this fits the challenge perfectly and it feels very natural. Some of the other entries I''m looking at feel really forced. I think this is great, and I like the composition.</td>', 'I think this fits the challenge perfectly and it feels very natural. Some of the other entries I''m looking at feel really forced. I think this is great, and I like the composition.', '2009-03-04 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
