(5287884, 770006, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. Nice sense of depth to it, great colors (love the way that red pops). I like the way that this feels loved and well-worn, but there''s this duality because it was cast away and it''s alone now.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. Nice sense of depth to it, great colors (love the way that red pops). I like the way that this feels loved and well-worn, but there''s this duality because it was cast away and it''s alone now.', '2009-03-04 10:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
