(5287897, 769498, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for this photo a lot and your title really pulls it together. Nice framing with the blackboard, nice dof and good clarity on the camera.</td>', 'I like the idea for this photo a lot and your title really pulls it together. Nice framing with the blackboard, nice dof and good clarity on the camera.', '2009-03-04 10:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
