(5287926, 769988, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this, I think it feels like a nice, honest glimpse into a person (even if it was staged - good job). I like he lighting and the composition. Reminds me of those I-Spy books. At first I thought what I now think is a bit for a horse was handcuffs, hahaha.</td>', 'I like this, I think it feels like a nice, honest glimpse into a person (even if it was staged - good job). I like he lighting and the composition. Reminds me of those I-Spy books. At first I thought what I now think is a bit for a horse was handcuffs, hahaha.', '2009-03-04 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287944, 769782, 98141, '<td valign="top">Way out of focus. Too dark. A lot of distracting shadows going on.</td>', 'Way out of focus. Too dark. A lot of distracting shadows going on.', '2009-03-04 11:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287958, 769545, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, nice shot. I love the smoothness of all the surfaces, the fact that the books are a part of a collection (really makes the shot feel purposeful and planned) and the blur of the pages is perfect - we can still read the title of the book behind the pages but there is a sense of motion. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Ah, nice shot. I love the smoothness of all the surfaces, the fact that the books are a part of a collection (really makes the shot feel purposeful and planned) and the blur of the pages is perfect - we can still read the title of the book behind the pages but there is a sense of motion. I like this a lot.', '2009-03-04 11:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287969, 770064, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. The chaotic background surface really works with this idea, and the stillness of the medicine balances it nicely. Great composition and I''m glad you kept it in color.</td>', 'This is a great shot. The chaotic background surface really works with this idea, and the stillness of the medicine balances it nicely. Great composition and I''m glad you kept it in color.', '2009-03-04 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287986, 769751, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. The lighting is really nice, the composition is really nice, and I usually hate wacky borders but for some reason I feel like this works here.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. The lighting is really nice, the composition is really nice, and I usually hate wacky borders but for some reason I feel like this works here.', '2009-03-04 11:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5287987, 770044, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like this shot. The black and white looks fantastic. I love the lighting here andthe composition. Great shot.</td>', 'Ooh, I like this shot. The black and white looks fantastic. I love the lighting here andthe composition. Great shot.', '2009-03-04 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
