(5288032, 768903, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s creative, it fits the challenge, and it''s not an image of a bunch of your stuff sitting on your floor, so it stands out. Great b&amp;w choice. I think the complexity of the music compared to the complexity of the branches and shadows tangling is so cool.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s creative, it fits the challenge, and it''s not an image of a bunch of your stuff sitting on your floor, so it stands out. Great b&w choice. I think the complexity of the music compared to the complexity of the branches and shadows tangling is so cool.', '2009-03-04 11:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
