(5288093, 770018, 98141, '<td valign="top">YUM that makes me hungry. I love mini cupcakes... Great, great colors in this. Love the dof. I think this is just fantastic. Also a clever idea for the challenge - you sure must be sweet!</td>', 'YUM that makes me hungry. I love mini cupcakes... Great, great colors in this. Love the dof. I think this is just fantastic. Also a clever idea for the challenge - you sure must be sweet!', '2009-03-04 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288094, 768415, 98141, '<td valign="top">Haha, what a fantastic reflection shot! I love that we can see the clouds, and I don''t know how you captured such a clear reflection on what seems to be a parking lot. Great compositon. Favorited.</td>', 'Haha, what a fantastic reflection shot! I love that we can see the clouds, and I don''t know how you captured such a clear reflection on what seems to be a parking lot. Great compositon. Favorited.', '2009-03-04 11:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
