(5288208, 769723, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you noticed this or not, but at the base of the mountains the snow/ground fans out and has a V shaped crevice above it.  Kind of mirrors the snow angel in a way.<br/> <br/>Clever, creative, good use of a stunning background to positive effect.  10 from me - see you on the front page.  Congrats!</td>', 'Don''t know if you noticed this or not, but at the base of the mountains the snow/ground fans out and has a V shaped crevice above it.  Kind of mirrors the snow angel in a way. Clever, creative, good use of a stunning background to positive effect.  10 from me - see you on the front page.  Congrats!', '2009-03-04 11:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288215, 770091, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking duck.  What kind is it?  I''ve not seen one with a bill that long.<br/> <br/>As for the photo - a little more room to the left would help the composition some IMO.  On the monitor I''m using the whites look somewhat overexposed.  Looks like you stopped motion and kept it sharp.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a cool looking duck.  What kind is it?  I''ve not seen one with a bill that long. As for the photo - a little more room to the left would help the composition some IMO.  On the monitor I''m using the whites look somewhat overexposed.  Looks like you stopped motion and kept it sharp. Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-03-04 11:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
