(5288258, 770114, 61349, '<td valign="top">High score for fellow equestrian, but that saddle could have been place differently, it makes me cringe looking at how its set up, possibly a switched with the guitar to balance it out.</td>', 'High score for fellow equestrian, but that saddle could have been place differently, it makes me cringe looking at how its set up, possibly a switched with the guitar to balance it out.', '2009-03-04 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288259, 770042, 98141, '<td valign="top">The lighting here feels harsh and it''s the first thing I notice. The frame also feels really crowded. I think a simpler subject - perhaps just the ball and glove? - would help focus on the details.</td>', 'The lighting here feels harsh and it''s the first thing I notice. The frame also feels really crowded. I think a simpler subject - perhaps just the ball and glove? - would help focus on the details.', '2009-03-04 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288273, 769906, 98141, '<td valign="top">Too much stuff is getting cut off here - I think the ruler is the only thing in the frame that doesn''t get chopped off along an edge. I think that a more inclusive shot of a larger, messier destop would be better. Also, the white wire is bright and distracting, I''d move that.</td>', 'Too much stuff is getting cut off here - I think the ruler is the only thing in the frame that doesn''t get chopped off along an edge. I think that a more inclusive shot of a larger, messier destop would be better. Also, the white wire is bright and distracting, I''d move that.', '2009-03-04 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288278, 769772, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is cute, and I like the composition of it. I think that either the lighting could be different or maybe the contrast could go up a bit, but it doesn''t feel like it pops as much as it could, as far as colors and such go.</td>', 'This is cute, and I like the composition of it. I think that either the lighting could be different or maybe the contrast could go up a bit, but it doesn''t feel like it pops as much as it could, as far as colors and such go.', '2009-03-04 11:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288287, 770072, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke shot. Great composition. I don''t get a strong sense of personality from this though... It''s not really my place to say who you are or if this does convey your essence, but it doesn''t connect with me right off the bat.</td>', 'Nice smoke shot. Great composition. I don''t get a strong sense of personality from this though... It''s not really my place to say who you are or if this does convey your essence, but it doesn''t connect with me right off the bat.', '2009-03-04 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
