(5288685, 770101, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great spring colors but I almost feel that the background is too busy and distracts from the star of the show.</td>', 'Great spring colors but I almost feel that the background is too busy and distracts from the star of the show.', '2009-03-04 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288691, 769791, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen one of these in person - it''s like a locket but with room for more pictures, right? I think that''s really neat. I think the really shallow focus and lots of blur works well in this pic to make it feel more aged.</td>', 'I''ve never seen one of these in person - it''s like a locket but with room for more pictures, right? I think that''s really neat. I think the really shallow focus and lots of blur works well in this pic to make it feel more aged.', '2009-03-04 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288692, 769745, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a couple of cuties. I love when their eyes are like that: one light and one dark. I think a shallower DOF would make this pop a bit more. When taking pics of dogs/animals I''ve heard that it''s good to get down on their eye level rather than take pics from above them.</td>', 'What a couple of cuties. I love when their eyes are like that: one light and one dark. I think a shallower DOF would make this pop a bit more. When taking pics of dogs/animals I''ve heard that it''s good to get down on their eye level rather than take pics from above them.', '2009-03-04 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288699, 768989, 98141, '<td valign="top">Super simplicity. I''m not sure that I get the title, but I love the colors: the red contrasted with the creamy strings of lighter bits. I think it''s from compression, but the background seems a little blotchy on my monitor.</td>', 'Super simplicity. I''m not sure that I get the title, but I love the colors: the red contrasted with the creamy strings of lighter bits. I think it''s from compression, but the background seems a little blotchy on my monitor.', '2009-03-04 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288701, 769917, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I''m looking at used drumsticks and a drum set? Too too dark for me, I think if the drumset in the back had been softly lit it would make the idea easier to grasp.</td>', 'I think I''m looking at used drumsticks and a drum set? Too too dark for me, I think if the drumset in the back had been softly lit it would make the idea easier to grasp.', '2009-03-04 13:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288704, 770066, 98141, '<td valign="top">So, if I got this right, you turn from a knife-throwing magician to an 8-year-old to a time traveller to a watch salesman to a lady? There''s a lot going on in this pic and I don''t think it all goes together very sensibly. Maybe that''s your point?</td>', 'So, if I got this right, you turn from a knife-throwing magician to an 8-year-old to a time traveller to a watch salesman to a lady? There''s a lot going on in this pic and I don''t think it all goes together very sensibly. Maybe that''s your point?', '2009-03-04 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288714, 769418, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, as far as these clothes shots are concerned, I''m not a big fan of any of them. I think that there is more to you than the jeans and t-shirt you favor, and I think that if you photographed something else it might portray more personality. Even if you just took one element of this photo and focused on the technicals, I think this would portray personality better. Just a sandal with great lighting on a beach or a sidewalk, just travel books, just the camera... there are so many elements with potential here and by trying to cram them all in to one shot I think the connection between your personality and the viewer is lost.</td>', 'Okay, as far as these clothes shots are concerned, I''m not a big fan of any of them. I think that there is more to you than the jeans and t-shirt you favor, and I think that if you photographed something else it might portray more personality. Even if you just took one element of this photo and focused on the technicals, I think this would portray personality better. Just a sandal with great lighting on a beach or a sidewalk, just travel books, just the camera... there are so many elements with potential here and by trying to cram them all in to one shot I think the connection between your personality and the viewer is lost.', '2009-03-04 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288719, 769753, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this is cool, I''ve always wanted to try some light tricks like this.</td>', 'I think this is cool, I''ve always wanted to try some light tricks like this.', '2009-03-04 13:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288727, 769771, 98141, '<td valign="top">That black speck in the water is really distracting to me. I think with more focus on composition, this could be really great. As is, I think it''s just okay. Try including less water and more sky and positioning the boat further from the center.</td>', 'That black speck in the water is really distracting to me. I think with more focus on composition, this could be really great. As is, I think it''s just okay. Try including less water and more sky and positioning the boat further from the center.', '2009-03-04 13:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288733, 769826, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the purple in this, such a deep, vivid, beautiful color. Looks great against the black. Good job submitting a pic that captures a little playful personality without using your clothes.</td>', 'I love the purple in this, such a deep, vivid, beautiful color. Looks great against the black. Good job submitting a pic that captures a little playful personality without using your clothes.', '2009-03-04 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288738, 770011, 98141, '<td valign="top">Really grainy and a little overblown I think. Doesn''t feel like much thought was put into composition... The road outside and the gadget in the window are distracting because they stand out a lot.</td>', 'Really grainy and a little overblown I think. Doesn''t feel like much thought was put into composition... The road outside and the gadget in the window are distracting because they stand out a lot.', '2009-03-04 13:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288745, 769927, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very, very clever. I love the blues and greens in this. Nice, simple (but well done) composition.</td>', 'Very, very clever. I love the blues and greens in this. Nice, simple (but well done) composition.', '2009-03-04 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288754, 769332, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what this says about you, since it''s supposed to be a self-portrait: Are you a fireman? Are you a book-burner? Do you just enjoy this book and I''m trying to read way to much into this? Nice DOF, I like that I can still read the phrase "sexuale feminine" - nice focus control, hahaha.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what this says about you, since it''s supposed to be a self-portrait: Are you a fireman? Are you a book-burner? Do you just enjoy this book and I''m trying to read way to much into this? Nice DOF, I like that I can still read the phrase "sexuale feminine" - nice focus control, hahaha.', '2009-03-04 13:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288756, 769900, 98141, '<td valign="top">Those shoes certainly portray a person with an extroverted personality... but I think the set up doesn''t showcase them well. The shadows, for one thing and the all-inclusive dof. I think that if they had been placed differently or had there been a shallower DOF there might be more of a sense of structure to the shot.</td>', 'Those shoes certainly portray a person with an extroverted personality... but I think the set up doesn''t showcase them well. The shadows, for one thing and the all-inclusive dof. I think that if they had been placed differently or had there been a shallower DOF there might be more of a sense of structure to the shot.', '2009-03-04 13:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288759, 769978, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the smoothness of the car with the roughness of the countryside. I like this in b&amp;w but in an advanced challenge it might also look cool with selective desat.</td>', 'I love the smoothness of the car with the roughness of the countryside. I like this in b&w but in an advanced challenge it might also look cool with selective desat.', '2009-03-04 13:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288762, 769894, 89116, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot because of the DoF and the whole beauty (feather) vs. beast (barbed wire) theme.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for but that''s what I see in it.</td>', 'I really like this shot because of the DoF and the whole beauty (feather) vs. beast (barbed wire) theme.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for but that''s what I see in it.', '2009-03-04 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288764, 769894, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, I love the dof, the colors, the texture of the feather.</td>', 'I love this, I love the dof, the colors, the texture of the feather.', '2009-03-04 14:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288766, 769349, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the grainyness of this photo works well with the subject/idea you''re trying to convey. Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'I think the grainyness of this photo works well with the subject/idea you''re trying to convey. Nice composition and lighting.', '2009-03-04 14:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288778, 770078, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wii Fit defines you? Represents you? I think perhaps you were trying to convey the idea of getting in shape, but the inclusion of all things Wii distracts from that in my opinion.</td>', 'Wii Fit defines you? Represents you? I think perhaps you were trying to convey the idea of getting in shape, but the inclusion of all things Wii distracts from that in my opinion.', '2009-03-04 14:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288782, 769839, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun shot. I don''t think that it feel very self-portraity (yes, that is now a word) but with the title I think it just might do okay. Really stellar, the clouds work so well in this. Great composition.</td>', 'This is such a fun shot. I don''t think that it feel very self-portraity (yes, that is now a word) but with the title I think it just might do okay. Really stellar, the clouds work so well in this. Great composition.', '2009-03-04 14:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288797, 769456, 95137, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the depth of field isn''t deep enough</td>', 'Nice composition, but the depth of field isn''t deep enough', '2009-03-04 14:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288801, 770011, 95137, '<td valign="top">love the concept, but mostly out of focus, pity</td>', 'love the concept, but mostly out of focus, pity', '2009-03-04 14:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288807, 769346, 95137, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2009-03-04 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288817, 770045, 81530, '<td valign="top">Hot Pastor ... Hot Pasta?</td>', 'Hot Pastor ... Hot Pasta?', '2009-03-04 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288835, 769884, 81530, '<td valign="top">ha ha. Great idea.</td>', 'ha ha. Great idea.', '2009-03-04 14:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288837, 768903, 81530, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2009-03-04 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288844, 768562, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2009-03-04 14:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288848, 769620, 81530, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2009-03-04 14:36:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5289023, 770094, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very creative and my favourite of the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative and my favourite of the challenge.', '2009-03-04 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289204, 769346, 103411, '<td valign="top">Sleazeville Gazette... niiiice.</td>', 'Sleazeville Gazette... niiiice.', '2009-03-04 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289218, 769774, 88822, '<td valign="top">Well executed.</td>', 'Well executed.', '2009-03-04 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289222, 770078, 88822, '<td valign="top">Smart, and interesting, the background does not work for me, it''s too drab comparing to the lively colors of the wii fit.</td>', 'Smart, and interesting, the background does not work for me, it''s too drab comparing to the lively colors of the wii fit.', '2009-03-04 16:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289224, 769580, 88822, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great processing.  Amazing clutter.</td>', 'Very nice. Great processing.  Amazing clutter.', '2009-03-04 16:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289231, 769454, 88822, '<td valign="top">I think black angel wings added somewhere in the photo would work very well :)  Great shot, and composition.  The light is a little harsh though.</td>', 'I think black angel wings added somewhere in the photo would work very well :)  Great shot, and composition.  The light is a little harsh though.', '2009-03-04 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289233, 769747, 89116, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!  I love the simplistic attitude it gives off.</td>', 'Very interesting shot!  I love the simplistic attitude it gives off.', '2009-03-04 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289234, 769917, 89116, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what it is since the image is so dark.  Maybe lighten it up a bit to give some detail to the background?</td>', 'I can''t really tell what it is since the image is so dark.  Maybe lighten it up a bit to give some detail to the background?', '2009-03-04 16:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289237, 769324, 88822, '<td valign="top">Could be an interesting idea, if these building were taken from a different angle and not head on.</td>', 'Could be an interesting idea, if these building were taken from a different angle and not head on.', '2009-03-04 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289238, 770116, 89116, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2009-03-04 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289241, 770018, 88822, '<td valign="top">I can imagine a person with blue hair and sprinkles :)  Well balanced shot, nice dof, and good light.</td>', 'I can imagine a person with blue hair and sprinkles :)  Well balanced shot, nice dof, and good light.', '2009-03-04 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289242, 769905, 89116, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of flat to me.  Try upping the contrast and maybe using a wider aperture to give the background some blur and make the subject pop more next time.</td>', 'Seems kind of flat to me.  Try upping the contrast and maybe using a wider aperture to give the background some blur and make the subject pop more next time.', '2009-03-04 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289246, 769726, 89116, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Way to think about the challenge!</td>', 'Awesome!  Way to think about the challenge!', '2009-03-04 16:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289249, 769338, 88822, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.</td>', 'interesting idea.', '2009-03-04 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289250, 770018, 89116, '<td valign="top">You must be sweet...or blue, one or the other.  Anyway, I like how you positioned the cupcake in the frame and it would not be such a great shot without the other cupcakes in the background.</td>', 'You must be sweet...or blue, one or the other.  Anyway, I like how you positioned the cupcake in the frame and it would not be such a great shot without the other cupcakes in the background.', '2009-03-04 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289260, 769813, 88822, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better if the crop wasn''t so tight, and the subject had more room.</td>', 'I think this would work better if the crop wasn''t so tight, and the subject had more room.', '2009-03-04 17:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289264, 769665, 88822, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2009-03-04 17:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289274, 769036, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The picture looks a little washed out.  It would be interesting to see more of the tripod, basically taking the picture vertically.</td>', 'Good idea.  The picture looks a little washed out.  It would be interesting to see more of the tripod, basically taking the picture vertically.', '2009-03-04 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289279, 769905, 88822, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. good b&amp;w, but here is what I don''t like about this.  There is a light post that sticks out of the phone booth.  The background is too busy with light stands buidlings trees.  I think a shallow dof would work better, focusing on the phone more.</td>', 'interesting idea. good b&w, but here is what I don''t like about this.  There is a light post that sticks out of the phone booth.  The background is too busy with light stands buidlings trees.  I think a shallow dof would work better, focusing on the phone more.', '2009-03-04 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289281, 769745, 34058, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue eyes!  I want one!  I like the picture, but I might have moved the puppy pad and just had the newspapers!</td>', 'Beautiful blue eyes!  I want one!  I like the picture, but I might have moved the puppy pad and just had the newspapers!', '2009-03-04 17:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289282, 768666, 88822, '<td valign="top">Well captured, but for me the trees in the background are a little distracting from the main subject.  The gloves and the helmet are barely noticeable at first look.</td>', 'Well captured, but for me the trees in the background are a little distracting from the main subject.  The gloves and the helmet are barely noticeable at first look.', '2009-03-04 17:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289291, 769772, 88822, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  More contrast and saturation would probably give the image more pop.</td>', 'Cool idea.  More contrast and saturation would probably give the image more pop.', '2009-03-04 17:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289293, 770018, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo! So light and airy and cheerful.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo! So light and airy and cheerful.', '2009-03-04 17:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289295, 769791, 88822, '<td valign="top">Well composed and lit.  I like the shadows. I wish the dof wasn''t so apparent.</td>', 'Well composed and lit.  I like the shadows. I wish the dof wasn''t so apparent.', '2009-03-04 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289296, 769454, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like Coley''s tree! And his umbrella. Good job.</td>', 'This looks like Coley''s tree! And his umbrella. Good job.', '2009-03-04 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289297, 769731, 88822, '<td valign="top">Well lit and composed image.  Personally I would crop the left side to get rid of the cabinet there.</td>', 'Well lit and composed image.  Personally I would crop the left side to get rid of the cabinet there.', '2009-03-04 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289298, 770046, 34058, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture, I assume that is snow falling!  I just would have cropped out that little thing in the bottom corner</td>', 'This is a neat picture, I assume that is snow falling!  I just would have cropped out that little thing in the bottom corner', '2009-03-04 17:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289300, 770101, 43774, '<td valign="top">So beautiful. Background is perfect.</td>', 'So beautiful. Background is perfect.', '2009-03-04 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289302, 770098, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I have a problem with the halo around the badge.  The halo takes away from a well composed image.</td>', 'Good idea, but I have a problem with the halo around the badge.  The halo takes away from a well composed image.', '2009-03-04 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289303, 770074, 88822, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this one.  Well lit and composed.</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this one.  Well lit and composed.', '2009-03-04 17:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289307, 769771, 88822, '<td valign="top">Personally I would crop the left side to hide the buoy, and crop the bottom to move the ship off center line.  Otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'Personally I would crop the left side to hide the buoy, and crop the bottom to move the ship off center line.  Otherwise nice shot.', '2009-03-04 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289311, 769917, 34058, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark to really see anything</td>', 'Just a little too dark to really see anything', '2009-03-04 17:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289313, 769782, 88822, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better if it was in focus.  Not being able to read the text is very frustrating 8&gt;)</td>', 'This would have been so much better if it was in focus.  Not being able to read the text is very frustrating 8>)', '2009-03-04 17:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289315, 770078, 34058, '<td valign="top">I love the wii fit!  I like the colors in this but the towel or sheet in the background is a little distracting</td>', 'I love the wii fit!  I like the colors in this but the towel or sheet in the background is a little distracting', '2009-03-04 17:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289316, 770034, 88822, '<td valign="top">Seeing the reflection of the room in the cat''s eye just makes this shot.  Really nice.</td>', 'Seeing the reflection of the room in the cat''s eye just makes this shot.  Really nice.', '2009-03-04 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289317, 769814, 34058, '<td valign="top">Really cool capture!  Just wish that the words were more in focus</td>', 'Really cool capture!  Just wish that the words were more in focus', '2009-03-04 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289318, 769803, 34058, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop to get rid of the doorway at the top might have been nice</td>', 'I think a closer crop to get rid of the doorway at the top might have been nice', '2009-03-04 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289319, 769980, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good try.  I think including a dress shirt and a tie would work better with this title.  Brown polo type shirt does not really say business.</td>', 'Good try.  I think including a dress shirt and a tie would work better with this title.  Brown polo type shirt does not really say business.', '2009-03-04 17:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289322, 769751, 22301, '<td valign="top">The background looks photoshopped especially where the texture turns into pure white. along with the front leg of the chair on the viewer''s left disappears and blends into the wall. It is possible you added texture to a section of wall, but can''t figure out an explanation for the chair. The lighting is great and well balanced. I am going to ask for a validation in hopes that it is legal and you can get the  "This image has been validated" text added to your image so that others will not think they should vote you down for improper editing(even though this is frowned upon). 7</td>', 'The background looks photoshopped especially where the texture turns into pure white. along with the front leg of the chair on the viewer''s left disappears and blends into the wall. It is possible you added texture to a section of wall, but can''t figure out an explanation for the chair. The lighting is great and well balanced. I am going to ask for a validation in hopes that it is legal and you can get the  "This image has been validated" text added to your image so that others will not think they should vote you down for improper editing(even though this is frowned upon). 7', '2009-03-04 17:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289329, 768473, 88822, '<td valign="top">Very stereotypical 8&gt;)  Well lit image, but in my opinion I would crop the top  to hide the shelf in the background and just a bit on the left to hide the object in the top left corner.  Yes the top crop would get rid of that as well....<br/>Also I would give more space at the bottom of the shot to give the bear more room to "speak".  Still like this shot.</td>', 'Very stereotypical 8>)  Well lit image, but in my opinion I would crop the top  to hide the shelf in the background and just a bit on the left to hide the object in the top left corner.  Yes the top crop would get rid of that as well....Also I would give more space at the bottom of the shot to give the bear more room to "speak".  Still like this shot.', '2009-03-04 17:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289334, 768674, 22301, '<td valign="top">very nice still life, works well for the challenge 8</td>', 'very nice still life, works well for the challenge 8', '2009-03-04 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289337, 769239, 88822, '<td valign="top">Very very slick.  Love the idea.  The dof is wonderful, and I specially like the door on the right of the photo.  Personally I would shift the whole point of view up.  Having less floor at the bottom, and more wall ceiling at the top. Still very cool shot.</td>', 'Very very slick.  Love the idea.  The dof is wonderful, and I specially like the door on the right of the photo.  Personally I would shift the whole point of view up.  Having less floor at the bottom, and more wall ceiling at the top. Still very cool shot.', '2009-03-04 17:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289338, 769907, 22301, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract quality, the negative space leaves space for one to be with their thoughts</td>', 'very nice abstract quality, the negative space leaves space for one to be with their thoughts', '2009-03-04 17:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289341, 769894, 88822, '<td valign="top">I actually like the fact that you have motion in the feather.  It gives meaning to the title.  Very nice.</td>', 'I actually like the fact that you have motion in the feather.  It gives meaning to the title.  Very nice.', '2009-03-04 17:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289348, 770018, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent food shot, the bokeh flows nicely</td>', 'excellent food shot, the bokeh flows nicely', '2009-03-04 17:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289349, 769839, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good flow and balance.</td>', 'Good flow and balance.', '2009-03-04 17:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289350, 769046, 22301, '<td valign="top">thats cool, really lets you in to what you are into. One of my highest rated so far.</td>', 'thats cool, really lets you in to what you are into. One of my highest rated so far.', '2009-03-04 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289355, 768989, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like it. To me it says that perhaps you hold to close and wrap yourself up in the lives of others, but you know this and hope others accept it as well. I am sure with this personality trait comes a loyalty not easily found.</td>', 'I like it. To me it says that perhaps you hold to close and wrap yourself up in the lives of others, but you know this and hope others accept it as well. I am sure with this personality trait comes a loyalty not easily found.', '2009-03-04 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289358, 768562, 22301, '<td valign="top">another well done entry IMO, the Bear shows the personality quite well.</td>', 'another well done entry IMO, the Bear shows the personality quite well.', '2009-03-04 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
