(5291701, 768309, 15407, '<td valign="top">I did something similar yet it turned out to be a disaster in the post processing so mine is tanking.  I had to use a backup procedure that just didn''t work... strictly Liquid Sunshine for the past 2 weeks. I had to display a photo of a motorcycle racing on my laptop screen into a 72mm Polo razing filter on my Nikon. Had to use my "Underwater Canon" to get the picture and tried to get a good depth of field in what was a compromised lighting.</td>', 'I did something similar yet it turned out to be a disaster in the post processing so mine is tanking.  I had to use a backup procedure that just didn''t work... strictly Liquid Sunshine for the past 2 weeks. I had to display a photo of a motorcycle racing on my laptop screen into a 72mm Polo razing filter on my Nikon. Had to use my "Underwater Canon" to get the picture and tried to get a good depth of field in what was a compromised lighting.', '2009-03-05 19:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
