(5291819, 769826, 59029, '<td valign="top">hmmmm...a chocolate lover likely living in Britain cause packaging is different than here in Canada...could be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67258" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SaraR</a>...<br/> <br/>nice shot, very simple and like the lines. And makes me want chocolate too! 7</td>', 'hmmmm...a chocolate lover likely living in Britain cause packaging is different than here in Canada...could be  SaraR... nice shot, very simple and like the lines. And makes me want chocolate too! 7', '2009-03-05 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291823, 769720, 59029, '<td valign="top">and a big fuzzy sweater...but hey that''s not a DSLR! :-) Good use of thirds, I''d say from the hat that you''re a man...and that''s my best guess as to who you are. 6</td>', 'and a big fuzzy sweater...but hey that''s not a DSLR! :-) Good use of thirds, I''d say from the hat that you''re a man...and that''s my best guess as to who you are. 6', '2009-03-05 20:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
