(5293858, 769503, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped, good exposure.  The tinyest of tiny things.... there''s something a quarter of the way up, in the door opening.. once I noticed it I couldn''t stop looking at it.... I know its only a minor minor imperfection but, in such a minimalist shot I can''t help seeing it all the time now.  Good use of the fisheye effect, I like the texture of the floor.  Well done.</td>', 'Nicely cropped, good exposure.  The tinyest of tiny things.... there''s something a quarter of the way up, in the door opening.. once I noticed it I couldn''t stop looking at it.... I know its only a minor minor imperfection but, in such a minimalist shot I can''t help seeing it all the time now.  Good use of the fisheye effect, I like the texture of the floor.  Well done.', '2009-03-07 04:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293859, 769940, 25486, '<td valign="top">You got the elements in the shot ok but, try to be more aware of the background.  The door frame, something hanging down and the thing with the red buttons on, top right detract and distract from the main subject.  Try to keep a clear uncluttered background, unless its part of the makeup of the image.</td>', 'You got the elements in the shot ok but, try to be more aware of the background.  The door frame, something hanging down and the thing with the red buttons on, top right detract and distract from the main subject.  Try to keep a clear uncluttered background, unless its part of the makeup of the image.', '2009-03-07 04:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293865, 769978, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The car, the open country road.  It works well in mono.  There''s something about the framing which doesn''t quire gell though for me. I think its the empty space top left.  If the sky had been more dramatic it would have filled it better. I know you can''t control the weather, as much as I''d like to!  I''m just wondering if getting right up close and low down to the car would be any better?  Use the car to fill the frame on the left, cutting out some of the dead foreground, with the road and trees on the left?  Just a suggestion.  I still like it though.</td>', 'Very nice. The car, the open country road.  It works well in mono.  There''s something about the framing which doesn''t quire gell though for me. I think its the empty space top left.  If the sky had been more dramatic it would have filled it better. I know you can''t control the weather, as much as I''d like to!  I''m just wondering if getting right up close and low down to the car would be any better?  Use the car to fill the frame on the left, cutting out some of the dead foreground, with the road and trees on the left?  Just a suggestion.  I still like it though.', '2009-03-07 04:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293866, 769497, 66635, '<td valign="top">Judi?</td>', 'Judi?', '2009-03-07 04:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293868, 769963, 66635, '<td valign="top">Silverfox?</td>', 'Silverfox?', '2009-03-07 04:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293870, 769729, 25486, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how this represents yourself ....  alone on a perch? Anyway its not a bad shot but could be cropped to cut out the dark area to the right, getting closer on the bird.  The snowflake which appears to be landing on the back of the birds head is unfortunate, it detracts from the photo IMO.  Pleasant shot though.</td>', 'I don''t get how this represents yourself ....  alone on a perch? Anyway its not a bad shot but could be cropped to cut out the dark area to the right, getting closer on the bird.  The snowflake which appears to be landing on the back of the birds head is unfortunate, it detracts from the photo IMO.  Pleasant shot though.', '2009-03-07 04:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293875, 769813, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, not an easy shot to pull off but, you do have complete control over the environment.  The very shallow depth of field I suspect is to try to give some depth to the shot but, in my opinion it doesn''t quite work.  The point of focus seems to be the upper edge of the foreground nut and the edge of the one alongside it.  Very little else if anything is in focus, which for me anyway makes the shot seem like a bit of misjudgement.  The offset of the image is a good idea to add interest but I thing a better angle could have been found, filling the frame whilst not being central.  never the less a very good effort, to be praised.</td>', 'Nicely lit, not an easy shot to pull off but, you do have complete control over the environment.  The very shallow depth of field I suspect is to try to give some depth to the shot but, in my opinion it doesn''t quite work.  The point of focus seems to be the upper edge of the foreground nut and the edge of the one alongside it.  Very little else if anything is in focus, which for me anyway makes the shot seem like a bit of misjudgement.  The offset of the image is a good idea to add interest but I thing a better angle could have been found, filling the frame whilst not being central.  never the less a very good effort, to be praised.', '2009-03-07 04:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293878, 769746, 25486, '<td valign="top">A busy bright, light joyful shot.  This hanging on the wall would brighten any room.  Just one tiny observation would be the gap that the flower bottom right has made in an otherwise frame filling sea of petals.  Very nice, I like it.</td>', 'A busy bright, light joyful shot.  This hanging on the wall would brighten any room.  Just one tiny observation would be the gap that the flower bottom right has made in an otherwise frame filling sea of petals.  Very nice, I like it.', '2009-03-07 04:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293879, 769754, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, excellent lighting, which makes the shot by the way.  The out of focus greens in the background make the rock stand out and the frame is full of movement because of the water.  Very well done.</td>', 'Nicely composed, excellent lighting, which makes the shot by the way.  The out of focus greens in the background make the rock stand out and the frame is full of movement because of the water.  Very well done.', '2009-03-07 04:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293880, 769892, 25486, '<td valign="top">I think I know who this is....maybe not?  Well composed, wonderful lighting and the footprints lead you into the shot.  One very small critique..... the camera / head of the tripod is exactly on the line of wave coming in but that''s such a small point its hardly worth mentioning.</td>', 'I think I know who this is....maybe not?  Well composed, wonderful lighting and the footprints lead you into the shot.  One very small critique..... the camera / head of the tripod is exactly on the line of wave coming in but that''s such a small point its hardly worth mentioning.', '2009-03-07 04:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293881, 769580, 25486, '<td valign="top">You cannot be serious, you live / work there!  I can''t imagine you set that up just for the shot, would have taken days to put it all away again.  You seriously need to tidy up.  Nice image, the mono works well.  Sharp and the fisheye effect is put to good use.</td>', 'You cannot be serious, you live / work there!  I can''t imagine you set that up just for the shot, would have taken days to put it all away again.  You seriously need to tidy up.  Nice image, the mono works well.  Sharp and the fisheye effect is put to good use.', '2009-03-07 05:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293882, 769286, 25486, '<td valign="top">I think this is an example all those that travel on the same train as me should follow.  Could be used as a campaign poster.  Nicely framed, not sure the out of focus foreground / background works though?  Good interpretation.</td>', 'I think this is an example all those that travel on the same train as me should follow.  Could be used as a campaign poster.  Nicely framed, not sure the out of focus foreground / background works though?  Good interpretation.', '2009-03-07 05:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293885, 769875, 25486, '<td valign="top">Bright, colourful, interesting subject.  I would have cropped more off the left side though.  Maybe not possible?  The shadow bottom left detracts slightly.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Bright, colourful, interesting subject.  I would have cropped more off the left side though.  Maybe not possible?  The shadow bottom left detracts slightly.  Nice shot though.', '2009-03-07 05:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293887, 770074, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very simple clean shot, well lit as you would expect as you have control of the environment.  Perhaps the string coiled down by the side of the instrument would have reinforced the idea a little more?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very simple clean shot, well lit as you would expect as you have control of the environment.  Perhaps the string coiled down by the side of the instrument would have reinforced the idea a little more?  Nice shot.', '2009-03-07 05:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293893, 770046, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot.  Its almost mono apart from the little bit of colour , what appears to be dark blue inside the boat.  I guess the bankside must be very close to the bottom of the frame?  I little more clear water at the bottom of the shot would have made the framing better.  The snow gives a ''gritty'' hard edge to the shot which accentuates the harshness of the weather conditions.  Good shot and interpretation.</td>', 'I like this image a lot.  Its almost mono apart from the little bit of colour , what appears to be dark blue inside the boat.  I guess the bankside must be very close to the bottom of the frame?  I little more clear water at the bottom of the shot would have made the framing better.  The snow gives a ''gritty'' hard edge to the shot which accentuates the harshness of the weather conditions.  Good shot and interpretation.', '2009-03-07 05:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293895, 769866, 25486, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, framing, colours and sense of movement.  An all round accomplished effort.</td>', 'Great lighting, framing, colours and sense of movement.  An all round accomplished effort.', '2009-03-07 05:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293897, 769377, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation.  The image seems a bit ''flat''.  I know the elements themselves are flat but maybe its the lighting?  Did you use direct flash?  If so it may have been better with bounce flash or natural light if that''s possible?  The white area at the top of the frame detracts in my opinion.  Good effort.</td>', 'Good interpretation.  The image seems a bit ''flat''.  I know the elements themselves are flat but maybe its the lighting?  Did you use direct flash?  If so it may have been better with bounce flash or natural light if that''s possible?  The white area at the top of the frame detracts in my opinion.  Good effort.', '2009-03-07 05:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293898, 769839, 25486, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Fills the frame with interest, lighting is jus about spot on, not too dark, not too light. You can see the buildings internal lights and the swirling architecture leads you in, as if you need it! Technically brilliant artistically very good.</td>', 'Excellent. Fills the frame with interest, lighting is jus about spot on, not too dark, not too light. You can see the buildings internal lights and the swirling architecture leads you in, as if you need it! Technically brilliant artistically very good.', '2009-03-07 05:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293899, 770015, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good idea of how to get it all in.  Not sure I''d want a camera or computer of mind in the sand!  I might have cropped a bit more of the sky out by having a slightly higher viewpoint?  very good effort though.</td>', 'Good idea of how to get it all in.  Not sure I''d want a camera or computer of mind in the sand!  I might have cropped a bit more of the sky out by having a slightly higher viewpoint?  very good effort though.', '2009-03-07 05:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293903, 769791, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like it, even though I don''t know what it is, which is a bit annoying I feel that if it was that bit more in focus I could tell what it is.  Maybe that''s intentional, in which case well done.  It forces you to look at it and study the elements to come up with an answer.  The colours are great and the shadow gives depth. Well done.</td>', 'I like it, even though I don''t know what it is, which is a bit annoying I feel that if it was that bit more in focus I could tell what it is.  Maybe that''s intentional, in which case well done.  It forces you to look at it and study the elements to come up with an answer.  The colours are great and the shadow gives depth. Well done.', '2009-03-07 05:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293905, 769971, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very difficult exposure because of the high contrast but for me the foreground is just that too dark which detracts from the shot in my opinion.  That said its a beutiful location, well framed, the sky has interest, though not a lot.  Very nice image.</td>', 'A very difficult exposure because of the high contrast but for me the foreground is just that too dark which detracts from the shot in my opinion.  That said its a beutiful location, well framed, the sky has interest, though not a lot.  Very nice image.', '2009-03-07 05:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293910, 768309, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good idea, shame the PC is out of focus, due to the wide appature I guess?  The backlighting of the PC was a good idea to add interest to what could have been a mundane shot.  However the light is poking above the PC which I find distracting.  Good effort though.</td>', 'Good idea, shame the PC is out of focus, due to the wide appature I guess?  The backlighting of the PC was a good idea to add interest to what could have been a mundane shot.  However the light is poking above the PC which I find distracting.  Good effort though.', '2009-03-07 05:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294005, 770059, 1024, '<td valign="top">1024 is my DPC user number, such a coincidence??? You get an extra point for this.</td>', '1024 is my DPC user number, such a coincidence??? You get an extra point for this.', '2009-03-07 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294036, 768918, 12076, '<td valign="top">Well, bonus points for a Browns fan.  Not fair to the others but so what.  <br/>Nice collection of the stuff that is you.  Good in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Well, bonus points for a Browns fan.  Not fair to the others but so what.  Nice collection of the stuff that is you.  Good in B&W.', '2009-03-07 10:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294069, 768562, 12076, '<td valign="top">Best of Show in my opinion.  Nice job.</td>', 'Best of Show in my opinion.  Nice job.', '2009-03-07 10:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294080, 769904, 104616, '<td valign="top">The angle is kinda strange. Can''t quite tell what I''m looking at. But overall, quite good.</td>', 'The angle is kinda strange. Can''t quite tell what I''m looking at. But overall, quite good.', '2009-03-07 10:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
