(5294101, 769865, 104616, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think the edges are too blurry. It leaves only a fraction of the picture in focus, and, for me, it''s not enough.</td>', 'I like it, but I think the edges are too blurry. It leaves only a fraction of the picture in focus, and, for me, it''s not enough.', '2009-03-07 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
