(5295755, 769866, 88136, '<td valign="top">i like how confused and abstract this feels. perhaps it is sucking in the stress you feel over possibly being the last tester, creating a more wild and crazed atmospher. i might have prefered if this a bit more room at the top, or maybe had a little less tilt, but i still like it and enjoy the feeling i get from looking at it</td>', 'i like how confused and abstract this feels. perhaps it is sucking in the stress you feel over possibly being the last tester, creating a more wild and crazed atmospher. i might have prefered if this a bit more room at the top, or maybe had a little less tilt, but i still like it and enjoy the feeling i get from looking at it', '2009-03-08 12:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295756, 769517, 88136, '<td valign="top">i really like how this was done. i might hav prefered a straight on shot of the glasses rather then the left tilt, but thats just me. nice choice in background too, it adds an important element to the photo</td>', 'i really like how this was done. i might hav prefered a straight on shot of the glasses rather then the left tilt, but thats just me. nice choice in background too, it adds an important element to the photo', '2009-03-08 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295758, 769978, 88136, '<td valign="top">beautiful car you have there. i like the shadow, it seems to convey that the car is just aching to reach and and grab the road</td>', 'beautiful car you have there. i like the shadow, it seems to convey that the car is just aching to reach and and grab the road', '2009-03-08 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295760, 770030, 88136, '<td valign="top">hmm, not sure how you convinced the northern lights to cooperate for this one, must have been interesting. looks like you took a lot of time on your light guy, i might have liked his a bit more if he was a bit to the left, just so he wouldnt be overlapping the corner of the house</td>', 'hmm, not sure how you convinced the northern lights to cooperate for this one, must have been interesting. looks like you took a lot of time on your light guy, i might have liked his a bit more if he was a bit to the left, just so he wouldnt be overlapping the corner of the house', '2009-03-08 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295761, 769349, 88136, '<td valign="top">nice idea:) i love the grain and the texture of the wire, it really conveys the exact tone and feeling of your title</td>', 'nice idea:) i love the grain and the texture of the wire, it really conveys the exact tone and feeling of your title', '2009-03-08 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295802, 769517, 101445, '<td valign="top">well done, great idea</td>', 'well done, great idea', '2009-03-08 13:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295825, 770044, 25486, '<td valign="top">A simple telling image.  Just made for a mono shot really.  For me though you''ve cropped just a little bit too close on the bottom and the left, just a smidge of black background would be better, in my opinion.  Very striking image all the same.</td>', 'A simple telling image.  Just made for a mono shot really.  For me though you''ve cropped just a little bit too close on the bottom and the left, just a smidge of black background would be better, in my opinion.  Very striking image all the same.', '2009-03-08 14:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295826, 769517, 25486, '<td valign="top">Well done very clever.  A simple elegant image.  Well framed and lit sometimes people forget the basics.  For this challenge an excellent entry.</td>', 'Well done very clever.  A simple elegant image.  Well framed and lit sometimes people forget the basics.  For this challenge an excellent entry.', '2009-03-08 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295846, 769864, 25486, '<td valign="top">I''m sure Freud would have something to say about this interpretation... I can see how/why people may compare themselves to a tree... I suppose... But, why this particular tree? A tree that is pretty unremarkable it has to be said, which stands behind a large brick wall, not much of an outlook really? Anyway, in my opinion the photo could have been improved by choosing a more dramatic viewpoint. Perhaps from the base of the tree looking up, to emphasise how tall the tree is, or at an angle to use those lines of brickwork in some sort of abstract way, possibly from the wall side showing what the tree "sees" from the other side. You need to explore other possibilities for framing the shot because the diagonal line of the top of the wall cuts right through the main subject, which does the shot no favours. The main thing is that you took the time to photograph something and entered the challenge. Keep doing that and you will be rewarded.</td>', 'I''m sure Freud would have something to say about this interpretation... I can see how/why people may compare themselves to a tree... I suppose... But, why this particular tree? A tree that is pretty unremarkable it has to be said, which stands behind a large brick wall, not much of an outlook really? Anyway, in my opinion the photo could have been improved by choosing a more dramatic viewpoint. Perhaps from the base of the tree looking up, to emphasise how tall the tree is, or at an angle to use those lines of brickwork in some sort of abstract way, possibly from the wall side showing what the tree "sees" from the other side. You need to explore other possibilities for framing the shot because the diagonal line of the top of the wall cuts right through the main subject, which does the shot no favours. The main thing is that you took the time to photograph something and entered the challenge. Keep doing that and you will be rewarded.', '2009-03-08 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295853, 769333, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, the vignette effect works well. The main subject is in focus and its colour contrasts well with the background to give that "brightness bursting out of the drab" feel. The green shoots bottom right give the shot some balance and a reference for the flower. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice colours, the vignette effect works well. The main subject is in focus and its colour contrasts well with the background to give that "brightness bursting out of the drab" feel. The green shoots bottom right give the shot some balance and a reference for the flower. Very nicely done.', '2009-03-08 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295865, 769894, 25486, '<td valign="top">The interpretation is ok, the colours are great, contrasting well.  The sharp focus on the feather? and then the tail being blown about gives the movement impression as if struglling to get free!  I love the rusting texture of the barbed wire and the soft green background.  Very good.</td>', 'The interpretation is ok, the colours are great, contrasting well.  The sharp focus on the feather? and then the tail being blown about gives the movement impression as if struglling to get free!  I love the rusting texture of the barbed wire and the soft green background.  Very good.', '2009-03-08 14:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295881, 769693, 25486, '<td valign="top">very abstract and I usually like that sort of thing, I do like it but...  I find myself blinking while looking at it, as if my eyes are not focusing properly but, its the shadows that are not sharp.  I appreciate how difficult that may have been, perhaps the auto focus was fooled by the mass white background. For me they needed to be sharp to get the full effect.  Also the shadows seem a bit washed out, bluey grey rather than deep shadows. To me that harsh contrast would have worked better.  Never the less a very good shot well done.</td>', 'very abstract and I usually like that sort of thing, I do like it but...  I find myself blinking while looking at it, as if my eyes are not focusing properly but, its the shadows that are not sharp.  I appreciate how difficult that may have been, perhaps the auto focus was fooled by the mass white background. For me they needed to be sharp to get the full effect.  Also the shadows seem a bit washed out, bluey grey rather than deep shadows. To me that harsh contrast would have worked better.  Never the less a very good shot well done.', '2009-03-08 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295895, 768562, 92403, '<td valign="top">oh... are you? <br/>like the difference between the bear fabric and the red bow, and also the green part of the rose.</td>', 'oh... are you? like the difference between the bear fabric and the red bow, and also the green part of the rose.', '2009-03-08 14:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295901, 769900, 92403, '<td valign="top">Those are some cool funky high heels!<br/>I''m sure if you''re brave enough to wear them you have a very strong personality...<br/>Maybe a bit more DOF would help.<br/>Great concept!</td>', 'Those are some cool funky high heels!I''m sure if you''re brave enough to wear them you have a very strong personality...Maybe a bit more DOF would help.Great concept!', '2009-03-08 14:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
