(5295938, 769826, 92403, '<td valign="top">me too...</td>', 'me too...', '2009-03-08 14:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295946, 769893, 92403, '<td valign="top">the bottom part almost looks like caramel...<br/>hum</td>', 'the bottom part almost looks like caramel...hum', '2009-03-08 14:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295973, 769904, 25486, '<td valign="top">Wow, dramatic or what! I had to look at this for a while, turning my head sideways before I got the perspective and realised what I was looking at. How you can bring yourself to do that is beyond me? The colours, namely the blue of the ice is amazing the sweeping shape of the rock leads the eye up the shot to the shoes then the shape of the ice takes you along to the picks. Very well constructed to show the drama of the activity as well as the colours and the textures involved.</td>', 'Wow, dramatic or what! I had to look at this for a while, turning my head sideways before I got the perspective and realised what I was looking at. How you can bring yourself to do that is beyond me? The colours, namely the blue of the ice is amazing the sweeping shape of the rock leads the eye up the shot to the shoes then the shape of the ice takes you along to the picks. Very well constructed to show the drama of the activity as well as the colours and the textures involved.', '2009-03-08 15:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295982, 770050, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the theme.  I''ve not seen this particular example of an in-car shot before, points for originality.  The few uses of the fish eye effect I''ve seen in this challenge have been well done and this is not an exception.  Inside the car is nice and sharp and crisp with muted colours, outside is blurred and bright with the yellow lines leading us away into the distance.  The feeling of speed is quite well achieved.  An all round good effort.</td>', 'Nice take on the theme.  I''ve not seen this particular example of an in-car shot before, points for originality.  The few uses of the fish eye effect I''ve seen in this challenge have been well done and this is not an exception.  Inside the car is nice and sharp and crisp with muted colours, outside is blurred and bright with the yellow lines leading us away into the distance.  The feeling of speed is quite well achieved.  An all round good effort.', '2009-03-08 15:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295987, 770036, 25486, '<td valign="top">An elegant high contrast shot.  Well lit, well framed, well composed to give a nice balance.  The focus may be a little soft but that could be intentional and it works well with the subject. Very good, well done.</td>', 'An elegant high contrast shot.  Well lit, well framed, well composed to give a nice balance.  The focus may be a little soft but that could be intentional and it works well with the subject. Very good, well done.', '2009-03-08 15:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295996, 770100, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very difficult to judge as I have no reference to the theme of the challenge but, as an image in its own right.... I can imagine it on a wall, very large 40X40 say, in a modern apartment perhaps?  It would provoke thoughts if it were that big or bigger.  The grainy texture along the top contrasting with the "bubbley" surface across the middle of the image to the out of focus bottom third.  I can''t help wondering what the colours involved were like and would it have delivered more impact in colour?  Nice entry all the same.</td>', 'Very difficult to judge as I have no reference to the theme of the challenge but, as an image in its own right.... I can imagine it on a wall, very large 40X40 say, in a modern apartment perhaps?  It would provoke thoughts if it were that big or bigger.  The grainy texture along the top contrasting with the "bubbley" surface across the middle of the image to the out of focus bottom third.  I can''t help wondering what the colours involved were like and would it have delivered more impact in colour?  Nice entry all the same.', '2009-03-08 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296015, 770115, 25486, '<td valign="top">By viture of the fact that the bird appears to be in the middle of the road?  Or that it, therefore you are a fighter?  Or am I reading too much into it? What would this image be without the title you gave it and the theme that it is given to represent? Take away those and its a very ordinary image but, it should be taken in context and therefore its a thought provoking image.  An idea cleverly portrayed. Thank you.</td>', 'By viture of the fact that the bird appears to be in the middle of the road?  Or that it, therefore you are a fighter?  Or am I reading too much into it? What would this image be without the title you gave it and the theme that it is given to represent? Take away those and its a very ordinary image but, it should be taken in context and therefore its a thought provoking image.  An idea cleverly portrayed. Thank you.', '2009-03-08 15:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296024, 769905, 25486, '<td valign="top">You must got up very early to get that shot, so points for dedication. Not so sure about the framing though...?  Moving left, getting lower down to use the roof of the booth to fill what is an empty nothing space at the moment, may have been better.  I like the use of mono for the city scene, colours in this type of shot easily distract from the main subject.  Well done for thinking of something new with a twist, that''s exactly what is needed.</td>', 'You must got up very early to get that shot, so points for dedication. Not so sure about the framing though...?  Moving left, getting lower down to use the roof of the booth to fill what is an empty nothing space at the moment, may have been better.  I like the use of mono for the city scene, colours in this type of shot easily distract from the main subject.  Well done for thinking of something new with a twist, that''s exactly what is needed.', '2009-03-08 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296031, 770094, 25486, '<td valign="top">But isn''t photography creativity?  After all what have you done here...?  I like the colours you have chosen.  I like the setup and the moment you''ve chosen to release the shutter.  Did you take a series and choose one or was it just a one off shot?  Well done for the thinking that''s gone into it.</td>', 'But isn''t photography creativity?  After all what have you done here...?  I like the colours you have chosen.  I like the setup and the moment you''ve chosen to release the shutter.  Did you take a series and choose one or was it just a one off shot?  Well done for the thinking that''s gone into it.', '2009-03-08 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296041, 768864, 25486, '<td valign="top">One of the better examples of the shadow person theme.  A little more thought has produced a more interesting image. The side lighting and the textured wall are simple elements well used to produce the image.  Whilst to be brutally honest, I don''t think the "shadow image" type of shot will win the challenge.  I applaud the thought that has gone into producing a diffent angle on it.  Well done, that''s what is needed and you will get rewards with that type of thinking.</td>', 'One of the better examples of the shadow person theme.  A little more thought has produced a more interesting image. The side lighting and the textured wall are simple elements well used to produce the image.  Whilst to be brutally honest, I don''t think the "shadow image" type of shot will win the challenge.  I applaud the thought that has gone into producing a diffent angle on it.  Well done, that''s what is needed and you will get rewards with that type of thinking.', '2009-03-08 15:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296046, 769349, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like this simple yet poiniant image.  Even without the theme of the challange and the title you have given it.  I would want to look at and study the image.  Its the point of focus, the line of the wire through the diagonal and the noise in the image which gives that gritty, sandy quality.  That and the colour. I can almost feel the rust between my fingers yet know that it will still hurt to be on the wrong end of the spines.  Excellent shot, of which I would be proud.  Only another photographer would say that of this image I suppose?</td>', 'I like this simple yet poiniant image.  Even without the theme of the challange and the title you have given it.  I would want to look at and study the image.  Its the point of focus, the line of the wire through the diagonal and the noise in the image which gives that gritty, sandy quality.  That and the colour. I can almost feel the rust between my fingers yet know that it will still hurt to be on the wrong end of the spines.  Excellent shot, of which I would be proud.  Only another photographer would say that of this image I suppose?', '2009-03-08 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296052, 769747, 25486, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I think I need to see your other images, I may learn something... As I said interesting and brave entry.  I hope you get somewhere with it.</td>', 'Interesting, I think I need to see your other images, I may learn something... As I said interesting and brave entry.  I hope you get somewhere with it.', '2009-03-08 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296057, 770006, 25486, '<td valign="top">I think I am becoming a lover of the abstract, maybe I just year for it.... The colours the angle and the subject combine here to force the viewer to stop and ponder as to the story behind it, or is that just me?  Thanks for showing me that.</td>', 'I think I am becoming a lover of the abstract, maybe I just year for it.... The colours the angle and the subject combine here to force the viewer to stop and ponder as to the story behind it, or is that just me?  Thanks for showing me that.', '2009-03-08 15:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296061, 770011, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like the title, made me smile.  That looks like an interesting vehicle. I''d love to have something with character and the time to keep it running of course.  I suspect I''ll never have either.  A simple shot which gives an insight into the life of the photographer, (if that''s really your car?).</td>', 'I like the title, made me smile.  That looks like an interesting vehicle. I''d love to have something with character and the time to keep it running of course.  I suspect I''ll never have either.  A simple shot which gives an insight into the life of the photographer, (if that''s really your car?).', '2009-03-08 15:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296062, 770030, 87252, '<td valign="top">Oh wow this is cool</td>', 'Oh wow this is cool', '2009-03-08 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296064, 769845, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to match the title and theme.  Colours and interest in the shapes, gives a sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice idea to match the title and theme.  Colours and interest in the shapes, gives a sense of movement.', '2009-03-08 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296071, 769731, 25486, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you are bemoaning or celebrating the fact that its your point  of view?  Either way its a nice idea with a bit more thought applied than some.  The lamp does a nice job, balanced by the window.  The colours are nice and warm inside while outside is a cold blue light, i.e. daylight.  The scene looks busy without being too cluttered.  Though maybe cropping to the left of the window may have been a little better.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you are bemoaning or celebrating the fact that its your point  of view?  Either way its a nice idea with a bit more thought applied than some.  The lamp does a nice job, balanced by the window.  The colours are nice and warm inside while outside is a cold blue light, i.e. daylight.  The scene looks busy without being too cluttered.  Though maybe cropping to the left of the window may have been a little better.  Well done.', '2009-03-08 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296072, 769723, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot</td>', 'Sweet shot', '2009-03-08 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296204, 769720, 103433, '<td valign="top">I love the camera !</td>', 'I love the camera !', '2009-03-08 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296367, 769770, 23317, '<td valign="top">The dogs ears make this shot very good!  Nice catch.  In my top 5</td>', 'The dogs ears make this shot very good!  Nice catch.  In my top 5', '2009-03-08 20:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296372, 768661, 23317, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I just felt the b&amp;w on this was the wrong choice.  With the yellow of the corn, the color would have been very nice</td>', 'I like the idea.  I just felt the b&w on this was the wrong choice.  With the yellow of the corn, the color would have been very nice', '2009-03-08 20:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296385, 769775, 23317, '<td valign="top">The shadow is distracting for me (I think ''cause it''s on the dog).  The dog''s action creating a blur is also a bit distracting.  The green of the grass and blue of the water could have popped a bit more with some levels adjustment.  I like the mud on the dog''s feet though.</td>', 'The shadow is distracting for me (I think ''cause it''s on the dog).  The dog''s action creating a blur is also a bit distracting.  The green of the grass and blue of the water could have popped a bit more with some levels adjustment.  I like the mud on the dog''s feet though.', '2009-03-08 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296386, 769620, 23317, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just didn''t get it.</td>', 'Sorry, I just didn''t get it.', '2009-03-08 20:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5296389, 769917, 23317, '<td valign="top">Needs more depth and brightness</td>', 'Needs more depth and brightness', '2009-03-08 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
