(5297862, 769956, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was tempted to be snarky about this and just leave a link to a google search for "Depth of field". (Sorry!)It does need a bit more focus on the keyboard, though. Maybe a little more light as well, but under basic rules you can probably have a dark keyboard or a washed out screen.</td>', 'I was tempted to be snarky about this and just leave a link to a google search for "Depth of field". (Sorry!)It does need a bit more focus on the keyboard, though. Maybe a little more light as well, but under basic rules you can probably have a dark keyboard or a washed out screen.', '2009-03-09 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297869, 770113, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really grainy, <strike>but I am not sure if this is due to a severe crop, ISO noise, sharpening, etc, or if it is an intentional effort for an effect.</strike> It''s a a cool view, however. The bike looks like it is riding down the barrel of the lens. <br/> <br/>Looking at it some more, it must have taken a fair amount of work to get this reflection in the camera''s mirror in this way. In spite of the graininess, I think I have to give you a decent vote for what you did accomplish with this one.</td>', 'Really grainy, but I am not sure if this is due to a severe crop, ISO noise, sharpening, etc, or if it is an intentional effort for an effect. It''s a a cool view, however. The bike looks like it is riding down the barrel of the lens.  Looking at it some more, it must have taken a fair amount of work to get this reflection in the camera''s mirror in this way. In spite of the graininess, I think I have to give you a decent vote for what you did accomplish with this one.', '2009-03-09 16:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297874, 769988, 83313, '<td valign="top">Obviously someone who likes horses, and the other details tell me this is the entry of a woman. I am going to guess this is from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59029" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Snaffles</a>.  I might also guess <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=3214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lynnesite</a>, but she uses a Canon and I see a Nikon lens in the pic.</td>', 'Obviously someone who likes horses, and the other details tell me this is the entry of a woman. I am going to guess this is from  Snaffles.  I might also guess  Lynnesite, but she uses a Canon and I see a Nikon lens in the pic.', '2009-03-09 16:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
