(5297934, 770011, 83313, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable amounts of compression artifacts showing here. Way more than the 113k file size should normally contain. I think at some time during working on this, you may have saved it with an excessive amount of compression. Or, you may have saved and opened a moderately compressed JPEG a few times, losing some clarity with each save. A good workflow is to save your file in either a TIFF or your image editor''s native format, until you are ready to resize and post the final product. That way you don''t lose any detail.</td>', 'Unbelievable amounts of compression artifacts showing here. Way more than the 113k file size should normally contain. I think at some time during working on this, you may have saved it with an excessive amount of compression. Or, you may have saved and opened a moderately compressed JPEG a few times, losing some clarity with each save. A good workflow is to save your file in either a TIFF or your image editor''s native format, until you are ready to resize and post the final product. That way you don''t lose any detail.', '2009-03-09 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297984, 770046, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that appeals to me, though I am finding it difficult to articulate why.  I like just the hint of color indicating that either better times are remembered, or better times are just ahead.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that appeals to me, though I am finding it difficult to articulate why.  I like just the hint of color indicating that either better times are remembered, or better times are just ahead.', '2009-03-09 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
