(5298434, 769564, 7343, '<td valign="top">Lots of the ''still life'' type shots.  Nothing wrong with them, but they really boil down to how they work as such - colors, composition, etc.  I like this one,  The colors seem a little muted but it works for me.  it is balanced without being symmetrical (i totally butchered that spelling).</td>', 'Lots of the ''still life'' type shots.  Nothing wrong with them, but they really boil down to how they work as such - colors, composition, etc.  I like this one,  The colors seem a little muted but it works for me.  it is balanced without being symmetrical (i totally butchered that spelling).', '2009-03-09 22:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298437, 769545, 7343, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  You went beyond what a lot of people would have done and just pose the books.  The fluttering pages is an excellent touch.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  You went beyond what a lot of people would have done and just pose the books.  The fluttering pages is an excellent touch.', '2009-03-09 22:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
