(5299919, 769893, 53316, '<td valign="top">You''re patient and you persevere in order to get a nice shot.  But considering the shot itself, and not the act of taking it... to me this says you''re what everybody expects, you''re perfect, you''re a type-A personality.  Because unfortunately the commonality of this type of shot here at DPC has colored my perspective. <br/> <br/>When I think about it more than just on first glance, though, my thoughts are different and deeper.  It''s a very lovely shot.  The colors make me think happy and warm things about the self behind the photo and I feel that the self is vibrant and fun, ready to experiment or to take on the day.</td>', 'You''re patient and you persevere in order to get a nice shot.  But considering the shot itself, and not the act of taking it... to me this says you''re what everybody expects, you''re perfect, you''re a type-A personality.  Because unfortunately the commonality of this type of shot here at DPC has colored my perspective.  When I think about it more than just on first glance, though, my thoughts are different and deeper.  It''s a very lovely shot.  The colors make me think happy and warm things about the self behind the photo and I feel that the self is vibrant and fun, ready to experiment or to take on the day.', '2009-03-10 22:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
