(5301752, 769811, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is oddly moving: the wide dark pants ending in the dark shoes like a very simple drawing, but monolithic nonetheless, leading backwards to the small dark headspace, and something a little sad about the tiny mostly rectilinear modern life artifacts, seguing with the crosshatched pattern of the top.  Do I make too much of this?  But this is what I see.  And the lighting suggests you have been flattened on some anonymous pavement.</td>', 'This is oddly moving: the wide dark pants ending in the dark shoes like a very simple drawing, but monolithic nonetheless, leading backwards to the small dark headspace, and something a little sad about the tiny mostly rectilinear modern life artifacts, seguing with the crosshatched pattern of the top.  Do I make too much of this?  But this is what I see.  And the lighting suggests you have been flattened on some anonymous pavement.', '2009-03-11 01:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5301759, 769349, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great title to go with your subject, we all feel like that sometimes, nice work.</td>', 'Great title to go with your subject, we all feel like that sometimes, nice work.', '2009-03-11 01:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
