(5302157, 768415, 97893, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, as if the time stands still.<br/>Lovely composition too, especially with the bird just standing<br/>on the verge of the line as if it would contemplate before crossing over. Or, as if this moment has led him to ponder about his own self. I like it!</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, as if the time stands still.Lovely composition too, especially with the bird just standingon the verge of the line as if it would contemplate before crossing over. Or, as if this moment has led him to ponder about his own self. I like it!', '2009-03-11 02:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
