(5302711, 769346, 100495, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the higher-than-expected scores and all the great comments. I''m very surprised a comedy entry did so well and it has given me a reason to enter more comedy in the future.<br/> <br/>It was a shame that the 150kb and 640px limit hurt the image so much; the printed element in particular uses a lot of data so I lost a lot of the detail in getting a file small enough.</td>', 'Thanks for the higher-than-expected scores and all the great comments. I''m very surprised a comedy entry did so well and it has given me a reason to enter more comedy in the future. It was a shame that the 150kb and 640px limit hurt the image so much; the printed element in particular uses a lot of data so I lost a lot of the detail in getting a file small enough.', '2009-03-11 03:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5302744, 769738, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hmm..I really like the texture and the abstract appeal of this shot. Too bad it didn''t do better with the voters.</td>', 'Hmm..I really like the texture and the abstract appeal of this shot. Too bad it didn''t do better with the voters.', '2009-03-11 03:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5302770, 769774, 100495, '<td valign="top">The image is well executed and I like the way the lighting fades to a proper black behind the figure. I don''t think the POV is particularly flattering as there''s no face-to-face contact for the viewer. The use of the reflective surface just mirrors this rather uninteresting view. The tight crop doesn''t help either.<br/> <br/>I think your scores indicate that there were few people who loved it and few who hated it.</td>', 'The image is well executed and I like the way the lighting fades to a proper black behind the figure. I don''t think the POV is particularly flattering as there''s no face-to-face contact for the viewer. The use of the reflective surface just mirrors this rather uninteresting view. The tight crop doesn''t help either. I think your scores indicate that there were few people who loved it and few who hated it.', '2009-03-11 03:57:29.000000', NULL, 0),
