(5308034, 770089, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is a case where I really wish I could have read the comments to know what you were thinking when you took this.<br/>Your words describe exactly what your picture is - an "intricate tapestry in disarray" - and it sounds wonderful! I just somehow, visually, didn''t quite get it then but wish I had scored it higher, in retrospect.</td>', 'This is a case where I really wish I could have read the comments to know what you were thinking when you took this.Your words describe exactly what your picture is - an "intricate tapestry in disarray" - and it sounds wonderful! I just somehow, visually, didn''t quite get it then but wish I had scored it higher, in retrospect.', '2009-03-11 12:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5308070, 768989, 100831, '<td valign="top">I just couldn''t figure this out although it was one that I looked at many times. But I love the abstract-ness and the color/tone is gorgeous!!</td>', 'I just couldn''t figure this out although it was one that I looked at many times. But I love the abstract-ness and the color/tone is gorgeous!!', '2009-03-11 12:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
